    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "\"step out of the loop\"... that's exactly it. but stepping out usually means coming back. you take a vacation, you go home, and then the phone rings and the cycle starts all over again. it's just a delay. i'm looking for something more permanent than a week in the mountains. i'm looking for actual, total stillness. like, no more decisions, no more pretending, no more weight. does that even make sense? or am i just being irrational?",
